  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>, then<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>Z</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math><br />If the argument of the above complex number is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Centre of the circle is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
